1
00:01:17,359 --> 00:01:18,480
Tingting

2
00:01:31,040 --> 00:01:32,159
Tingting

3
00:01:48,439 --> 00:01:49,799
Who are you?

4
00:01:57,840 --> 00:01:58,799
Mr. Yan.

5
00:01:59,959 --> 00:02:01,359
I'm not just a teacher.

6
00:02:02,359 --> 00:02:03,959
I'm also your Sir.

7
00:02:04,760 --> 00:02:06,200
You bastard!

8
00:02:06,640 --> 00:02:07,439
You...

9
00:02:08,599 --> 00:02:11,120
I sent Gu Ting your forged wanted poster.

10
00:02:11,639 --> 00:02:14,319
She's so naive. She actually believed it.

11
00:02:18,319 --> 00:02:20,120
Bastard!

12
00:02:48,479 --> 00:02:50,360
Dad!

13
00:02:59,360 --> 00:03:00,599
Dad!

14
00:03:01,639 --> 00:03:03,240
Get out of here!

15
00:03:03,800 --> 00:03:05,400
Leave me behind!

16
00:03:07,280 --> 00:03:08,639
What a touching father-daughter bond.

17
00:03:09,120 --> 00:03:09,919
I'm so moved.

18
00:03:10,599 --> 00:03:13,759
I injected her with a slow-acting poison.

19
00:03:14,120 --> 00:03:16,159
She doesn't have much time left.

20
00:03:16,159 --> 00:03:18,199
You'd better go save her.

21
00:03:18,960 --> 00:03:20,840
Bastard! I'll kill you!

22
00:03:21,840 --> 00:03:22,680
Dad!

23
00:03:31,800 --> 00:03:33,240
Sir, the police are here.

24
00:03:33,479 --> 00:03:34,439
Fall back!

25
00:03:34,439 --> 00:03:35,080
Copy that.

26
00:03:39,479 --> 00:03:40,919
Enjoy your reunion.

27
00:04:07,240 --> 00:04:08,039
Move in!

28
00:04:18,160 --> 00:04:18,959
Tingting.

29
00:04:23,639 --> 00:04:25,240
Slow-acting poison.

30
00:04:26,120 --> 00:04:27,279
Quick, to the hospital!

31
00:04:27,560 --> 00:04:28,319
Xiao Lin, after him!

32
00:04:28,319 --> 00:04:28,759
Yes, sir!

33
00:04:31,120 --> 00:04:32,160
Be careful!

34
00:04:34,240 --> 00:04:35,079
Old Gu!

35
00:04:35,480 --> 00:04:36,319
Take it easy.

36
00:04:36,680 --> 00:04:37,519
Old Gu!

37
00:04:40,759 --> 00:04:41,600
Old Gu!

38
00:04:41,639 --> 00:04:42,439
Hang in there!

39
00:04:44,120 --> 00:04:45,279
Save Tingting.

40
00:04:45,800 --> 00:04:47,160
Don't worry, Old Gu. I'll save her.

41
00:04:47,680 --> 00:04:48,839
I'll take good care of her.

42
00:04:49,800 --> 00:04:50,519
Save...

43
00:04:51,959 --> 00:04:53,879
Tingting.

44
00:05:18,079 --> 00:05:19,079
Who is the patient's family?

45
00:05:19,079 --> 00:05:19,720
I am.

46
00:05:20,079 --> 00:05:21,000
How are you related?

47
00:05:21,000 --> 00:05:22,279
Only the next of kin can sign.

48
00:05:22,720 --> 00:05:23,920
I'm her only family right now.

49
00:05:24,000 --> 00:05:25,279
I'm the only one who can sign.

50
00:05:32,240 --> 00:05:33,040
Please, doctor.

51
00:06:15,240 --> 00:06:16,079
How is she, doctor?

52
00:06:16,800 --> 00:06:18,000
Luckily, she was brought in just in time.

53
00:06:18,000 --> 00:06:19,600
The poison wasn't that strong.

54
00:06:19,800 --> 00:06:21,600
The patient is out of danger now.

55
00:06:21,600 --> 00:06:22,879
She'll be moved to a regular ward soon.

56
00:06:22,879 --> 00:06:24,079
Get ready to take care of her.

57
00:06:24,639 --> 00:06:25,439
Thank you, doctor.

58
00:06:26,000 --> 00:06:27,079
Thank you, doctor.

59
00:06:36,319 --> 00:06:37,120
Dad.

60
00:06:38,160 --> 00:06:38,959
Dad.

61
00:06:42,759 --> 00:06:43,800
You're awake, sweetie.

62
00:06:45,399 --> 00:06:47,199
You scared me to death.

63
00:06:47,199 --> 00:06:48,079
I'm just glad you're okay.

64
00:06:48,079 --> 00:06:48,920
I'm just glad you're okay.

65
00:06:53,079 --> 00:06:54,360
I'm sorry, Dad.

66
00:06:54,639 --> 00:06:56,399
For making you worry about me.

67
00:06:56,720 --> 00:07:01,040
You are my precious little girl.

68
00:07:02,199 --> 00:07:03,160
No matter what,

69
00:07:03,759 --> 00:07:04,720
I will always love you.

70
00:07:06,759 --> 00:07:07,720
Give me a hug.

71
00:07:23,560 --> 00:07:24,639
You're awake.

72
00:07:30,399 --> 00:07:31,560
I just...

73
00:07:31,720 --> 00:07:33,000
dreamed about my dad.

74
00:07:35,600 --> 00:07:36,519
It's all my fault.

75
00:07:36,959 --> 00:07:38,439
I got him hurt.

76
00:07:40,519 --> 00:07:41,800
It's not your fault.

77
00:07:42,800 --> 00:07:44,120
Stop blaming yourself.

78
00:07:45,480 --> 00:07:46,079
Li Wen.

79
00:07:46,399 --> 00:07:47,480
Where's my dad?

80
00:07:48,000 --> 00:07:49,600
I need to apologize to him.

81
00:07:50,839 --> 00:07:52,480
I shouldn't have yelled at him.

82
00:08:01,120 --> 00:08:02,720
What happened to my dad?

83
00:08:08,839 --> 00:08:09,839
Say something.

84
00:08:13,839 --> 00:08:15,199
Answer me!

85
00:08:15,920 --> 00:08:16,720
Your dad...

86
00:08:21,160 --> 00:08:21,959
Your dad...

87
00:08:25,319 --> 00:08:26,839
You're kidding, right?

88
00:08:26,839 --> 00:08:28,879
What could possibly happen to my dad?

89
00:08:32,960 --> 00:08:33,759
You're lying to me.

90
00:08:34,120 --> 00:08:34,960
Right?

91
00:08:41,519 --> 00:08:42,320
I'm going to find him.

92
00:08:42,320 --> 00:08:43,440
You haven't recovered yet.

93
00:08:43,440 --> 00:08:44,399
Take me to see him.

94
00:10:06,000 --> 00:10:07,159
Dad.

95
00:10:08,000 --> 00:10:09,440
I'm sorry.

96
00:10:16,240 --> 00:10:17,679
You were rescued in time

97
00:10:20,120 --> 00:10:21,919
entirely thanks to Gu Yan's efforts.

98
00:11:12,759 --> 00:11:14,840
I heard Gu Ting is awake.

99
00:11:33,159 --> 00:11:34,200
Yaoyao
